      "text": "3. The term \"outdoor commercial premises\" means the space directly in front of a ground floor commercial premises on the sidewalk or on any street opened pursuant to the Open Streets program established by Ad. Code section 19-107.1, or any outdoor off-street parking space or private yard adjacent to a ground floor commercial premises, where such premises is authorized to conduct certain business pursuant to this Order.",
